│ ### Personalized debt-management strategies                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ #### 1. Prioritize by interest rate, not just balance                                                                  │
│ If you have multiple debts, the most efficient payoff method is usually the avalanche approach:                        │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Pay minimums on all accounts                                                                                         │
│ - Direct extra cash to the highest APR debt first                                                                      │
│ - Once that is paid off, roll that payment into the next highest APR debt                                              │
