│ This helps reduce debt faster without overcommitting your monthly budget.                                              │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ #### 7. Automate to avoid interest and late-payment risk                                                               │
│ Even strong borrowers lose money through avoidable timing issues.                                                      │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ Recommended setup:                                                                                                     │
│ - Auto-pay minimum due on every debt account                                                                           │
│ - Add a second scheduled payment for targeted principal reduction                                                      │
