│                                                                                                                        │
│ Here’s a simple walkthrough of the main areas.                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ 1. Loan options                                                                                                        │
│ Common consumer lending categories include:                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Personal loans                                                                                                       │
│   - Typically used for debt consolidation, home improvement, medical expenses, or major purchases                      │
│   - Usually unsecured                                                                                                  │
│   - Approval often depends on income stability, risk profile, and compliance/KYC status                                │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Auto loans                                                                                                           │
│   - Used for vehicle purchases                                                                                         │
│   - Usually secured by the vehicle                                                                                     │
│   - Terms often vary based on down payment, loan amount, and borrower risk                                             │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Mortgage loans                                                                                                       │
│   - Used to purchase or refinance real estate                                                                          │
│   - Usually larger balances and longer terms                                                                           │
│   - Underwriting is more detailed and typically includes income, assets, liabilities, property details, and identity   │
│ verification                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ 2. Mortgage information                                                                                                │
│ For mortgages, the main structures usually include:                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Fixed-rate mortgage                                                                                                  │
│   - Interest rate stays constant                                                                                       │
│   - Predictable monthly principal and interest payments                                                                │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Adjustable-rate mortgage                                                                                             │
│   - Initial rate may be lower                                                                                          │
│   - Rate can change later based on market conditions                                                                   │
│   - Payment uncertainty is higher over time                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ Key mortgage factors:                                                                                                  │
│ - Down payment amount                                                                                                  │
│ - Loan-to-value ratio                                                                                                  │
│ - Debt-to-income ratio                                                                                                 │
│ - Credit/risk profile                                                                                                  │
│ - Cash reserves                                                                                                        │
│ - Property occupancy type                                                                                              │
│ - Insurance and taxes, which may be included in monthly payment                                                        │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ A typical monthly mortgage payment may include:                                                                        │
│ - Principal                                                                                                            │
│ - Interest                                                                                                             │
│ - Property taxes                                                                                                       │
│ - Homeowners insurance                                                                                                 │
│ - Possibly mortgage insurance                                                                                          │
│ - HOA dues, if applicable, though often paid separately                                                                │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ 3. Application status                                                                                                  │
│ If you already submitted a loan application, I can help check its status and details. To do that, I’d need your loan   │
│ application ID. Once you provide it, I can look up:                                                                    │
│ - Current status                                                                                                       │
│ - Requested amount                                                                                                     │
│ - Purpose                                                                                                              │
│ - Any next steps or missing items                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ 4. Payment schedules                                                                                                   │
│ Loan payment schedules generally depend on:                                                                            │
│ - Loan amount                                                                                                          │
│ - Interest rate                                                                                                        │
│ - Term length                                                                                                          │
│ - Payment frequency                                                                                                    │
│ - Whether the loan is amortizing, interest-only, or has a balloon structure                                            │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ Typical schedule types:                                                                                                │
│ - Monthly amortizing payments                                                                                          │
│   - Most common for personal loans and mortgages                                                                       │
│   - Each payment includes interest plus some principal                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Biweekly payments                                                                                                    │
│   - Can reduce total interest over time in some cases                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ - Interest-only period                                                                                                 │
│   - Lower initial payments                                                                                             │
│   - Higher later payments when principal repayment begins                                                              │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ For mortgages, amortization means:                                                                                     │
│ - Early payments are more interest-heavy                                                                               │
│ - Later payments shift more toward principal                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                        │
│ 5. What I can help you do next                                                                                         │
